  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Why the split exists (ADR-0020)",
      "items": [
        "OME's InventoryDetails gave ambiguous disk units, MediaType UNKNOWN for NVMe, no thread count",
        "Only OME knows the name ocp4-nyc-prod-worker-03; only the iDRAC measures CapacityBytes and TotalThreads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What live hardware corrected",
      "items": [
        "2026-09-08, iDRAC9: the Service Tag is Oem.Dell.DellSystem.NodeID, not SerialNumber; iDRAC7/8 unconfirmed",
        "2026-09-10, production: TargetName held an OS hostname; the address is DeviceManagement[0].NetworkAddress"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Still open",
      "items": [
        "The iDRAC GPU VRAM check (docs/field-test-checklist.md part 3) has not run on real hardware",
        "One fleet-wide read-only iDRAC account: the auth guard disables it after 3 rejections, aborts after 10"
      ]
    }
  ]
